# VS Code REST Client (`humao.rest-client`). Run top to bottom.
# The Refresh Token is an HttpOnly cookie and is sent automatically.

@host = http://localhost:3000/api
@email = dana@betonaviv.co.il
@password = CorrectHorse42!

### Login — 200 + accessToken + safe user + Set-Cookie
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Unknown account — 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nobody@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Wrong password — 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "WrongPassword99!" }

### Non-active account — 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "banned@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Password missing — 400 REQUEST_VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "a@b.com" }

### Email malformed — 400 REQUEST_VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email", "password": "x" }

### Password empty — 400 REQUEST_VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "a@b.com", "password": "" }

### Email normalised, not rejected — 200
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "  DANA@BetonAviv.CO.IL  ", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Valid Access Token — 200
GET {{host}}/health-auth
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### No header — 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{host}}/health-auth

### Malformed token — 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{host}}/health-auth
Authorization: Bearer not.a.real.token

### No Bearer prefix — 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{host}}/health-auth
Authorization: {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Refresh — 200 + new accessToken + new Set-Cookie (old one retired)
# @name refresh
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh

### New Access Token works — 200
GET {{host}}/health-auth
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.accessToken}}

### No cookie — 401 INVALID_REFRESH_TOKEN
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken=

### Garbage cookie — 401 INVALID_REFRESH_TOKEN
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken=garbage

### Access Token used as Refresh Token — 401 INVALID_REFRESH_TOKEN
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken={{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Refresh Token used as Access Token — 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
# Paste a refreshToken from the Set-Cookie header of the Login response.
GET {{host}}/health-auth
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_A_REFRESH_TOKEN

### Replay a retired Refresh Token — 401, and revokes the whole family
# Paste the refreshToken value from before the Refresh request above.
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken=PASTE_THE_RETIRED_REFRESH_TOKEN

### The current Refresh Token is now dead too — 401 INVALID_REFRESH_TOKEN
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh

### Expired tokens: set ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS=1 / REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS=2, restart, wait, retry.

### Health — 200
GET {{host}}/health

### Unmatched route — 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/nope
